# Input

```scss
@layer   #{$layers} ;

@LAYER #{ $layer }{
  .a { color: red; }
}

@layer reset,#{$name},   components;

@layer theme-#{$name}.Base {}

@layer framework.#{$sub};

@layer #{$a}.#{$b},#{$c}-suffix;

@import url("theme.css") layer(#{$layer});

```


# Formatted

```scss
@layer #{$layers};

@layer #{$layer} {
	.a {
		color: red;
	}
}

@layer reset, #{$name}, components;

@layer theme-#{$name}.Base {
}

@layer framework.#{$sub};

@layer #{$a}.#{$b}, #{$c}-suffix;

@import url("theme.css") layer(#{$layer});

```
